Description:
 linuxmuster-prepare - linuxmuster.net pre setup configuration scripts
Changes:
 linuxmuster-prepare (7.4.2) lmn74; urgency=low
 .
   * fix(lmn-prepare): strip legacy journaled-quota mount options
     (usrjquota=/grpjquota=/jqfmt=) from ext4 fstab entries before enabling
     the modern on-disk quota feature, and mask the now-redundant
     quotaon-root.service/quotaon.service systemd units, fixing
     quotaon-root.service failing permanently at boot on hosts upgraded
     from 7.3. Verified end to end across a real reboot.
